# NAME: DirectSupplement
# AUTHOR: UykiZhao
# REPO: https://github.com/UykiZhao/Clash-Party-Override-Rule
# UPDATED: 2026-08-08
# PURPOSE: China-sensitive direct rules. Placed BEFORE the ad rule-set so
#          payment, banking, government, domestic AI and Tencent diagnostic
#          domains are never swallowed by REJECT.

